WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.917
That gonna fit everyone?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.708
Yeah, easily. Twelve customers total.

00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:06.875
How do they turn a profit?

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.792
$1,250 a head, that's how.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.292
What are we eating, a Rolex?

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:13.875
It's one of his classics.

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:18.250
You have to try the mouthfeel
of the mignonette.

00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:19.542
Please don't say mouthfeel.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.625
Tonight will be madness.

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:23.917
Welcome.

00:00:24.917 --> 00:00:28.083
We'll endeavor to make your evening
as pleasant as possible.

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:37.667
Welcome to Hawthorn.

00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:40.333
Here, we are family.

00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:41.208
Yes, Chef!

00:00:41.292 --> 00:00:43.958
We harvest. We ferment. We gel.

00:00:44.792 --> 00:00:46.417
-They gel?
-We gel.

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:50.042
He's not just a chef. He's a storyteller.

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:53.042
The game is trying to guess
what the overarching theme

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:54.875
of the entire meal is gonna be.

00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:57.583
You won't know until the end.

00:00:58.292 --> 00:01:01.917
-Who are you?
-I am Margot.

00:01:02.417 --> 00:01:03.542
Why do you care?

00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:06.458
I have to know if you're with us,
or with them.

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:08.292
This menu...

00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:10.125
The pictures, they're of us.

00:01:10.792 --> 00:01:12.375
This guest list...

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:14.542
-How did they get these?
-It's not good.

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:16.542
This entire evening...

00:01:16.958 --> 00:01:19.625
-Jesus Christ!
-This is just theater, it's stagecraft!

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:20.542
We're leaving, now.

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:23.250
...has been painstakingly planned.

00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:27.667
This is real, isn't it?

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:29.250
What the hell is going on?

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:33.333
We now offer you a 45 second head start.

00:01:34.292 --> 00:01:37.708
Okay, 45 seconds starts now.

00:01:39.542 --> 00:01:41.333
This is what you're paying for.

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:44.500
Get out of my way.

00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:48.125
It's all part of the menu.

00:01:48.792 --> 00:01:50.500
-It's okay.
-No, we're gonna die tonight.

00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:51.833
-Yes, we are.
-Yeah.

00:01:55.292 --> 00:02:00.333
Happy birthday to you!

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.458
You told them it was my birthday?

00:02:02.958 --> 00:02:04.500
Seemed funny about three hours ago.

